  "description": "CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120). RA(id primary key, k no index; rows (id, k) (3, 1), (1, 2), (2, 1), t 'a1' to 'a3') with RB(k primary key: keys 2, 1; u 'b1', 'b2'); QA(id primary key, k non-unique index; rows (3, 1), (1, 3), (2, 2), t 'a1' to 'a3') with QB(k non-unique index: keys 2, 3, 1; u 'b1' to 'b3'). In RA storage, id and key order differ; in QA storage, id order and k order differ. Each of SELECT t, u FROM RA INNER JOIN RB ON RA.k = RB.k; SELECT t, u FROM RA LEFT JOIN RB ON RA.k = RB.k; SELECT t, u FROM QA INNER JOIN QB ON QA.k = QB.k; SELECT t, u FROM QB INNER JOIN QA ON QA.k = QB.k opened as a dynaset and then as a snapshot, all rows read. Asks whether a join's dynaset comes in its snapshot's order or in another (a key order of either table).",
